of looking at it.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.040 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I do want to talk --

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.777
Because I'm fascinated by
this idea of a Freedom Dividend.

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
Before we do that, it does see
like you're having

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.348
