00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:10.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that --
-It's a bit less than that

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:12.485 size:84% position:42%
But if you look around,
who are the big winners

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:14.187 line:92%
