companies paying zero.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:31.070
If we give ourselves our tin
fair share of every Amazon sale,

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.739 size:75% position:38%
every Google search,
every Facebook ad,

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:35.108 size:84% position:42%
every robot-truck mile,
we can easily afford

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:37.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
$1,000 a month
for every American.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
