[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:39.712 --> 00:04:41.748 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:43.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know,
one thing you talk about,

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:45.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
