00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:54.761 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You'd get it, too.

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:57.497
-Hey, look, trust me, I woul
not have had you on the show

00:04:57.497 --> 00:05:02.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
