in on the Yang plan.

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:04.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
But explain --
It's very interesting,

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
the philosophy behind
the idea of why it's good

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.174 line:92%
that everybody would get it.

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:09.042 line:92%
'Cause some people would say

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:12.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
