this $1,000 a month, as well?"

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:13.146 line:92%
Can you just explain that?

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:15.214 size:84% position:42%
-Well, if you look at
the Alaskan experience,

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:16.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
everyone's getting the
oil dividend,

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
