to the richest.

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:21.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
And because of that,
it's universally popular.

00:05:21.387 --> 00:05:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's no stigma
attached to it.

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:24.390
It's not like I'm paying for it,
you're getting it.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.593
You don't need to monitor
people's circumstances.

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:28.661 line:92%
There are no incentives to say

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
