than I really am."

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:33.499
And so because of that, in
a deep-red Conservative stat

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:34.867 line:92%
with a Republican governor

00:05:34.867 --> 00:05:36.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
