is wildly popular.

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:39.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so if we make this
a true right of citizenship,

00:05:39.472 --> 00:05:41.874 line:92%
it will be popular nationwide.

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:43.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:48.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
You had an idea that I'm -
I'm very behind the idea of ho

00:05:48.081 --> 00:05:51.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
bad a viewing experience the
State of the Union is.

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is something
you agree with, yes?

00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:54.020 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I completely agree.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's gotten bizarrely
unwatchable.

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:58.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
It's very performative.

00:05:58.091 --> 00:06:00.693
It doesn't feel like you get
a lot of information out of it

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:04.230
What is your idea for how to fix
the State of the Union?

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.033 size:84% position:42%
-So, my plan is to take
the American scorecard,

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:08.901 size:78% position:39%
