00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:13.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every year at the
State of the Union,

00:06:13.573 --> 00:06:15.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll be the first presiden
to use PowerPoint.

00:06:15.174 --> 00:06:19.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hopefully that's a good thing.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:23.015 line:92%
-I can't imagine PowerPoints

00:06:23.015 --> 00:06:25.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
