$1,000 a month,

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:28.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I like the -- I like
your moxie.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:30.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thanks so much
for being here.

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:33.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's really interesting having
someone out there

00:06:33.493 --> 00:06:35.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
who is talking about thing
nobody else is.

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:36.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you, man.
I appreciate it.

00:06:36.763 --> 00:06:38.297 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Andrew Yang, everybody.

